  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato and parsnip into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648852d9e762579290dabfe0-f86870da.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While veggies are roasting, finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Roughly chop silverbeet.\n• Drain sweetcorn.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648852d9e762579290dabfe0-78570254.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and half the butter over medium-high heat.\n• Add onion and cook, stirring occasionally, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and garlic & herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water, vegetable stock pot and sweetcorn. Stir to combine, bring to the boil, then reduce heat to medium and simmer until slightly reduced, 4-6 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648852d9e762579290dabfe0-d6dd7178.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While soup is simmering, cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks and place on a second lined oven tray.\n• Add a drizzle of olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Sprinkle over shredded Cheddar cheese. Bake until golden, 5-7 minutes",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648852d9e762579290dabfe0-f22422f0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop chives.\n• Divide the creamy potato, parsnip and corn soup between bowls.\n• Top with cheesy croutons and chives. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648852d9e762579290dabfe0-ba659d66.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop chives.\n• Divide the creamy potato, parsnip and corn soup between bowls.\n• Top with the cheesy croutons and chives. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648852d9e762579290dabfe0-0ad5aac5.jpeg"
    }
  ]
